<metadata><name>Day 29 - Devils Pulpit, Trimble, Crow's Nest, Ring Kiln</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.791491" lon="-79.975229"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on the east side of Creditview Rd, immediately north of the Grange…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.794140" lon="-80.012860"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Belfountain Conservation Area: Enter from Forks of the Credit Rd. Paid: $8.50 per adult admission + $10 vehicle permit (+HST). Joins the route near km 4.3 (390 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.801909" lon="-79.989378"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Devil's Pulpit Side Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed Ring Kiln Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.802809" lon="-79.994460"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Trimble Side Trail, heading south-west.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.798513" lon="-80.002537"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Junction. Continue straight to stay on the Trimble Side Trail, heading south-west. (the blue-blazed Crow's Nest Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.795726" lon="-80.010178"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: End of the Trimble Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
